# Frontend Design (BaikalStageGroup CRM)

Before restyling, read `.cursor/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md`. For chrome (sidebar, lists, modals, tables) also load `product-ui-patterns.md` and `minimal-ui-patterns.md` §1.

## Brief

B2B CRM for event production: quotes, warehouse, calendar, payroll. Users live in the app all day. UI is Russian. Density is a feature.

## Chosen aesthetic (do not mix)

**Refined Minimal, Linear-style product chrome.** Not editorial, not brutalist, not soft/warm, not playful.

- Type: Golos Text (400 / 500 / 600). Tabular nums on data. No 700 on every heading.
- One accent: `--accent` (brand cyan). Neutrals do the rest. Accent on <10% of pixels.
- Radius 6–8px on controls, 8–12px on panels. Pills only for tags, dots, toggles, calendar dates.
- Hairlines over shadows. Solid surfaces over glass.

## Hard no (anti-patterns.md)

- Purple / magenta / aurora gradients (`#ec14fe`, mesh, body glows)
- Glassmorphism (`backdrop-blur` on cards, nav, login)
- Pill CTAs (`rounded-full` on buttons)
- Stacked gummy shadows, `hover:scale` on every control
- `transition-all`, raw hex in components, emoji as icons

## Tokens

All color/type/space come from `web/src/app/globals.css`. Add a token before adding a one-off value.
